title: Capturing thoughts (e.g. in writing) feels quantum.
pid: 4d8b1a01-ae7b-4b9b-8043-6ece77160979
body: |2-
  There's a useful pattern, I think,
  alternating the settling of thoughts and written capture of them.
  It feels like traversing a quantum realm;
  enormous vistas of possible futures are vaguely at play.

  There's probably something similar for artistic renderings --
  performance, sculpture, etc.
